  "subtitle": "Halved aubergines filled with spiced lamb and topped with feta",
  "excerpt": "Aubergine halves are roasted until soft, then filled with spiced lamb mince cooked with allspice, cinnamon, and tomatoes. Crumbled feta goes over the top at the end. This is a Middle Eastern classic that works well as a main with flatbread or rice.",
