      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "Score the cut surface of each aubergine in a cross-hatch pattern before roasting. This helps them cook through faster and makes it easier to scoop out the flesh later if you choose to." }]
      },
      {
